  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      168.21,
      203.33,
      395.49,
      227.27
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE DELTOTA MAHFALUL ULAMA ARABICCOLLEGE",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      241.13,
      401.89,
      302.87
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS an Arabic College called and known as the\u201cDeltota Mahfalul Ulama Arabic College\u201d has heretofore beenformed for the purpose of effectually carrying out its objectsand transacting all matters connected with the said ArabicCollege according to the rules agreed to by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      316.73,
      401.9,
      378.47
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Arabic College has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be advantage to grant the saidapplication :",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      392.33,
      401.9,
      416.27
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      430.13,
      401.88,
      454.07
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the \u201cDeltota Mahfalul UlamaArabic College (Incorporation)\u201d Act, No. of 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      467.93,
      401.89,
      592.67
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many persons as now are members of the \u201cDeltotaMahfalul Ulama Arabic College\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cArabic College\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as members ofthe Corporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporate,with perpetual succession under the name and style of the\u201cDeltota Mahfalul Ulama Arabic College\u201d (hereinafter referredto as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) and by that name may sue and be sued,with full power and authority to have and use a common sealand alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      606.53,
      401.87,
      630.47
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      174.57,
      644.33,
      401.86,
      668.27
    ],
    "text": "(a) to provide for training in and promotion of Islamicculture ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      432.31,
      443.86,
      441.38
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
