      390.05,
      397.17,
      441.23
    ],
    "text": "(f) to authorize in conduction seminars, lectures, workshops and othe activities by the central institute toachieve the objectives of the school and to derivebenefits ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.87,
      456.53,
      397.18,
      481.07
    ],
