    "text": "8.(1) The Moneys and property of the Corporationhowever derived shall be applied solely towards thepromotion of its objects as set forth herein, and no portionthereof shall be paid or transferred, directly or indirectly, byway of dividend, loan, bonus or otherwise, howsoever, byway of profit, to the members of the Corporation.",
