      398.99
    ],
    "text": "12.The seal of the Corporation shall not be affixed toany instrument whatsoever, except in the presence of theSecretary or a member of the Board as may be duly authorizedby the Board and another member of the Board who shallsign their namens on the instrument in token of their presenceand such signing shall be independent of the signing of anyperson as a witness.",
