      412.25,
      401.88,
      472.79
    ],
    "text": "13.(1) The Board shall cause to be maintained a registerin which every person who on the date of commencement ofthis Act, is a member of the Corporation, and every personthereafter duly admitted as members of the Corporation shallhave inscribed in such register his name.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
